#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2
msgid "Converting Files"
msgstr "Konvertera filer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can convert files automatically without "
"needing user intervention. This allows a large number of files to be "
"converted using a script. <application>Gnumeric</application> is distributed"
" along with a program called <application>ssconvert</application> which is "
"the program used to convert files automatically. All of the file formats "
"supported by <application>Gnumeric</application> can be used except for the "
"PostScript and PDF file formats which operate through the printing system."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan konvertera filer automatiskt utan "
"att du behöver göra något. Då kan du konvertera många filer med ett skript. "
"Tillsammans med <application>Gnumeric</application> distribueras programmet "
"<application>ssconvert</application>, som används för automatisk "
"filkonvertering. Du kan använda alla filformat som stöds av "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>, utom PostScript och PDF som hanteras "
"via utskriftssystemet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:14
msgid ""
"This application is used, from the command line by specifying, any desired "
"options, an input file and an output file. For example, <_:screen-1/> would "
"convert an <application>Excel</application> format file to a "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> format file."
msgstr ""
"Du använder programmet från kommandoraden genom att ange eventuella flaggor,"
" en indatafil och en utdatafil. Exemplet <_:screen-1/> konverterar en fil i "
"<application>Excel</application>-format till "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-format."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:27
msgid ""
"The available import and export file formats which ssconvert can read can be"
" listed using <_:screen-1/> or <_:screen-2/> respectively."
msgstr ""
"Du kan visa vilka filformat ssconvert kan läsa respektive skriva med "
"<_:screen-1/> eller <_:screen-2/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:43
msgid ""
"Like other GNU command line applications, "
"<application>ssconvert</application> includes a manual page. This page can "
"be accessed by typing: <_:screen-1/> which will open the manual page. This "
"page can be navigated by typing the space bar or using the <keysym>Page "
"Up</keysym> and <keysym>Page Down</keysym> buttons. The "
"<application>man</application> program can be dismissed by typing the "
"<keysym>q</keysym> key."
msgstr ""
"Precis som andra kommandoradsprogram från GNU har "
"<application>ssconvert</application> en manualsida. Visa den med kommandot "
"<_:screen-1/>. Du kan bläddra på sidan med blanksteg eller tangenterna "
"<keysym>Page Up</keysym> och <keysym>Page Down</keysym>. Avsluta programmet "
"<application>man</application> genom att trycka på <keysym>q</keysym>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2
msgid "Printing to a Printer or a File."
msgstr "Skriv ut på skrivare eller till fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"The <interface>Print dialog</interface> includes the most important options "
"related to printing. More detailed options related to printing can be set in"
" the <interface>Page Setup dialog</interface>, detailed in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-printing-setup\"/>. Press the <guibutton>Print</guibutton> to"
" print out the workbook. Press the <guibutton>Print Preview</guibutton> "
"button to display the <interface>Print Preview</interface>."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <interface>Skriv ut</interface> innehåller de viktigaste "
"utskriftsalternativen. Fler inställningar finns i dialogrutan "
"<interface>Sidinställningar</interface>, som beskrivs i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-printing-setup\"/>. Klicka på <guibutton>Skriv ut</guibutton>"
" för att skriva ut arbetsboken. Klicka på "
"<guibutton>Förhandsgranska</guibutton> för att visa "
"<interface>Förhandsgranskning</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:15
msgid ""
"The number of tabs and the content of some of the tabs of the "
"<interface>Print dialog</interface> depends on the printer model you use. "
"Some of the described tabs or options may not be available with your "
"printer, especially when printing to a file."
msgstr ""
"Antalet flikar och innehållet på vissa flikar i dialogrutan <interface>Skriv"
" ut</interface> beror på skrivarmodellen. En del flikar och alternativ "
"kanske inte är tillgängliga för din skrivare, särskilt när du skriver ut "
"till en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:24
msgid "Print General"
msgstr "Allmänt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:26
msgid "<interface>Print Dialog Printer Tab</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Fliken Skrivare i dialogrutan Skriv ut</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:35
msgid ""
"Select the preferred <interface>printer</interface> in the upper half of the"
" tab. Your default printer is already highlighted when you open the "
"<interface>Printer dialog</interface>. Optionally select the "
"<guilabel>number of copies</guilabel> and a <guilabel>page range</guilabel> "
"in the lower half of the dialog. Click on <guibutton>Print</guibutton> to "
"send the document to your printing system."
msgstr ""
"Välj önskad <interface>skrivare</interface> i den övre delen av fliken. "
"Standardskrivaren är redan markerad när du öppnar dialogrutan "
"<interface>Skrivare</interface>. Välj vid behov <guilabel>antal "
"kopior</guilabel> och ett <guilabel>sidintervall</guilabel> i den nedre "
"delen av dialogrutan. Klicka på <guibutton>Skriv ut</guibutton> för att "
"skicka dokumentet till utskriftssystemet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:44
msgid ""
"When printing to a file you may want to change the <guilabel>output "
"name</guilabel> and <guilabel>folder</guilabel> before printing. You can "
"choose between saving a <keycap>PostScript</keycap> or a "
"<keycap>PDF</keycap> file."
msgstr ""
"Om du skriver ut till en fil kan du ändra <guilabel>utdatafilens "
"namn</guilabel> och <guilabel>mapp</guilabel> innan du skriver ut. Du kan "
"spara som <keycap>PostScript</keycap>- eller <keycap>PDF</keycap>-fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:54
msgid "<interface>Print Dialog Page Setup Tab</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Fliken Sidinställningar i dialogrutan Skriv ut</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:71
msgid ""
"The preview in the lower part of the tab gives you a small hint of how your "
"printed document will look like."
msgstr ""
"Förhandsgranskningen längst ned på fliken ger en fingervisning om hur det "
"utskrivna dokumentet kommer att se ut."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:63
msgid ""
"In the <guimenuitem>Page Setup</guimenuitem> tab you can choose several "
"options concerning the layout or the paper. Choose how many sheets shall "
"appear on one piece of paper, about two-sided printing, limit the printed "
"pages by even or odd page numbers or the scale in the layout section. Select"
" the <guilabel>paper type</guilabel> (e.g. preprinted) and the paper source "
"and output tray in the paper section. <_:tip-1/>"
msgstr ""
"På fliken <guimenuitem>Sidinställningar</guimenuitem> kan du välja "
"alternativ för sidlayout och papper. Ange hur många sidor från kalkylbladet "
"som ska placeras på ett pappersark, om du vill skriva ut dubbelsidigt, om "
"bara jämna eller udda sidor ska skrivas ut samt skalan i avsnittet för "
"layout. Välj <guilabel>papperstyp</guilabel> (till exempel förtryckt "
"papper), papperskälla och utmatningsfack i pappersavsnittet. <_:tip-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:80
msgid "Print Range"
msgstr "Utskriftsintervall"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:82
msgid "<interface>Print Dialog Range Tab</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Fliken Intervall i dialogrutan Skriv ut</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:91
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Print Range</guimenuitem> tab gives you the opportunity to "
"limit the <guilabel>range</guilabel> of the printed workbook. You may choose"
" between printing the whole workbook, only the selected or not the selected "
"area or a defined range of worksheets."
msgstr ""
"På fliken <guimenuitem>Utskriftsintervall</guimenuitem> kan du begränsa "
"<guilabel>intervallet</guilabel> för utskrift av arbetsboken. Du kan skriva "
"ut hela arbetsboken, enbart det markerade området, allt utom det markerade "
"området eller ett angivet intervall av kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:100
msgid "Print Job"
msgstr "Utskriftsjobb"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:102
msgid "<interface>Print Dialog Job Tab</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Fliken Utskriftsjobb i dialogrutan Skriv ut</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:119
msgid ""
"Some options may be unavailable due to user restrictions. Ask your local "
"administrator for further details."
msgstr ""
"Vissa alternativ kan vara otillgängliga på grund av användarbehörigheter. "
"Kontakta den lokala administratören för mer information."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:111
msgid ""
"In the <guimenuitem>Job</guimenuitem> tab you may change the "
"<guilabel>priority </guilabel> or add <guilabel>billing "
"information</guilabel> to the print job. Also you can choose to add a "
"<guilabel>cover page</guilabel> in front or after the printed worksheets. "
"Finally you can decide whether your job should be printed right now or at a "
"defined point in time. <_:important-1/>"
msgstr ""
"På fliken <guimenuitem>Utskriftsjobb</guimenuitem> kan du ändra jobbets "
"<guilabel>prioritet </guilabel> eller lägga till "
"<guilabel>faktureringsinformation</guilabel>. Du kan också lägga till ett "
"<guilabel>försättsblad</guilabel> före eller efter de utskrivna "
"kalkylbladen. Slutligen kan du välja om utskriften ska starta genast eller "
"vid en viss tidpunkt. <_:important-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:130
msgid "<interface>Print Dialog Image Quality Tab</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Fliken Bildkvalitet i dialogrutan Skriv ut</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:139
msgid ""
"In the <guimenuitem>Image Quality</guimenuitem> tab you can select the "
"<guilabel>resolution</guilabel> of the printed document depending on your "
"printer. No more, no less."
msgstr ""
"På fliken <guimenuitem>Bildkvalitet</guimenuitem> kan du välja "
"utskriftsdokumentets <guilabel>upplösning</guilabel>, beroende på skrivaren."
" Varken mer eller mindre."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:149
msgid "<interface>Print Dialog Finishing Tab</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Fliken Efterbehandling i dialogrutan Skriv ut</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:158
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Finishing</guimenuitem> tab lets decide whether you want a "
"blank <guilabel>separation sheet</guilabel> after every page, after the "
"whole job or no separation sheet at all."
msgstr ""
"På fliken <guimenuitem>Efterbehandling</guimenuitem> väljer du om ett tomt "
"<guilabel>mellanlägg</guilabel> ska infogas efter varje sida, efter hela "
"utskriftsjobbet eller inte alls."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:168
msgid "<interface>Print Dialog Advanced Tab</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Fliken Avancerat i dialogrutan Skriv ut</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:177
msgid ""
"In the <guimenuitem>Advanced</guimenuitem> tab you can change several "
"options depending on the printer model you use."
msgstr ""
"På fliken <guimenuitem>Avancerat</guimenuitem> kan du ändra flera "
"inställningar som beror på skrivarmodellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:187
msgid "Page Setup."
msgstr "Sidinställningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:188
msgid ""
"The <interface>Page Setup Dialog</interface> can be used to configure "
"various options related to printing out a workbook. Click on <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>File Menu</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Page Setup</guimenuitem> "
"</menuchoice> to activate the <interface>Page Setup</interface>."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Utskriftsinställningsdialogen</interface> används för att "
"konfigurera olika utskriftsalternativ för arbetsboken. Klicka på "
"<menuchoice> <guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Sidinställningar</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> för att öppna "
"<interface>Sidinställningar</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:197
msgid ""
"Remember that at any time you can click on the <guibutton>Print "
"preview</guibutton> button to see what your document looks like with your "
"selected options. See the <xref linkend=\"sect-printing-preview\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Du kan när som helst klicka på <guibutton>Förhandsgranska</guibutton> för "
"att se hur dokumentet ser ut med de valda inställningarna. Se <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-printing-preview\"/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:205
msgid ""
"Normally the specified settings apply only to the current sheet. Select "
"another sheet at the bottom of the <interface>Page Setup Dialog</interface> "
"or select <guilabel>Apply to all sheets of this workbook</guilabel>. You can"
" also save your adjustments by activating the <guilabel>save as default "
"settings</guilabel> flag."
msgstr ""
"Inställningarna gäller vanligtvis bara det aktuella kalkylbladet. Välj ett "
"annat blad längst ned i dialogrutan <interface>Sidinställningar</interface> "
"eller välj <guilabel>Använd på alla kalkylblad i arbetsboken</guilabel>. Du "
"kan också spara ändringarna som standardinställningar genom att markera "
"<guilabel>Spara som standardinställningar</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:216
msgid "Page Setup Dialog - Page"
msgstr "Dialogrutan Sidinställningar – Sida"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:220
msgid "<interface>Print Setup Page Tab</interface>"
msgstr ""
"<interface>Fliken Sida i dialogrutan Utskriftsinställningar</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:233
msgid "<interface>Print Setup Paper Type dialog</interface>"
msgstr ""
"<interface>Dialogrutan Papperstyp i utskriftsinställningarna</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:229
msgid ""
"Change the paper type by clicking the <guibutton>Change Paper "
"Type</guibutton> button. <_:figure-1/> Select the preferred printer or "
"choose Any Printer to see the formats supported by all printers. Pick a "
"<guilabel>paper size</guilabel> and <guilabel>page orientation</guilabel> "
"(portrait, landscape or reverse) to suit the best layout for your document."
msgstr ""
"Ändra papperstyp genom att klicka på <guibutton>Ändra "
"papperstyp</guibutton>. <_:figure-1/> Välj önskad skrivare eller valfri "
"skrivare om du vill se format som stöds av alla skrivare. Välj den "
"<guilabel>pappersstorlek</guilabel> och <guilabel>sidorientering</guilabel> "
"(stående, liggande eller omvänd) som passar dokumentets layout bäst."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:247
msgid ""
"Specify the required <guilabel>margins</guilabel> of the page. Nothing will "
"be printed inside these margins, not even page numbers. The margins will be "
"measured in the same units (millimetres, points or inches) as the paper "
"size. Change the <guilabel>unit</guilabel> in the paper and layout section "
"to best fit your needs. You may also specify whether the page is centered "
"<guilabel> horizontally</guilabel> and/or <guilabel>vertically</guilabel> on"
" the printable part of the page."
msgstr ""
"Ange sidans <guilabel>marginaler</guilabel>. Ingenting skrivs ut innanför "
"marginalerna, inte ens sidnummer. Marginalerna mäts i samma enheter "
"(millimeter, punkter eller tum) som pappersstorleken. Ändra "
"<guilabel>enhet</guilabel> i avsnittet för papper och layout så att den "
"passar dina behov. Du kan också ange om sidan ska centreras <guilabel> "
"vågrätt</guilabel> och/eller <guilabel>lodrätt</guilabel> på den utskrivbara"
" delen av pappret."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:259
msgid "Page Setup Dialog - Scale"
msgstr "Sidinställningar – Skala"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:262
msgid "<interface>Print Setup Scale Tab</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Fliken Skala i utskriftsinställningarna</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:271
msgid ""
"Select the scale applied while printing. You can choose between <guilabel>no"
" scaling</guilabel>, a <guilabel>fixed scaling</guilabel> or "
"<guilabel>automatic scaling</guilabel> to fit the workbook to a defined "
"number of paper sheets."
msgstr ""
"Välj skalan för utskriften. Du kan välja <guilabel>ingen "
"skalning</guilabel>, <guilabel>fast skalning</guilabel> eller "
"<guilabel>automatisk skalning</guilabel> för att anpassa arbetsboken till "
"ett angivet antal pappersark."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:280
msgid "Page Setup Dialog - Headers and Footers"
msgstr "Sidinställningar – Sidhuvud och sidfot"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:283
msgid "<interface>Print Setup Headers and Footers Tab</interface>"
msgstr ""
"<interface>Fliken Sidhuvud och sidfot i utskriftsinställningarna</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:292
msgid ""
"Select a predefined format for either the header or the footer. You can "
"define an header or a footer by clicking the "
"<guibutton>Configure</guibutton> button next to the according drop-down "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Välj ett förinställt format för sidhuvudet eller sidfoten. Du kan definiera "
"ett sidhuvud eller en sidfot genom att klicka på "
"<guibutton>Konfigurera</guibutton> bredvid motsvarande listruta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:299
msgid ""
"<interface>Print Setup Headers and Footers Configure Dialog</interface>"
msgstr ""
"<interface>Dialogrutan Konfigurera sidhuvud och sidfot i "
"utskriftsinställningarna</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:308
msgid ""
"Headers and footers are divided into left, center and right area. Select the"
" area you want to change. Insert a user-defined text or just select one or "
"several of the given options. When selecting <guibutton>time</guibutton> "
"and/or <guibutton>date</guibutton> you may choose the format by clicking on "
"the arrow next to the symbol and click on the preferred option. Beside the "
"according <guibutton>page</guibutton> number, the number of total "
"<guibutton> pages</guibutton> and the name of the according worksheet, you "
"may also insert the <guibutton>file</guibutton> name and/or "
"<guibutton>path</guibutton>. Finally you can select a defined "
"<guibutton>cell</guibutton> to appear in the header/footer. Additionally "
"there are a number of special <keycap>opcodes</keycap> for common options. "
"These are:"
msgstr ""
"Sidhuvuden och sidfötter delas in i tre områden: vänster, mitten och höger. "
"Välj det område du vill ändra. Skriv in egen text eller välj ett eller flera"
" av alternativen. När du väljer <guibutton>tid</guibutton> och/eller "
"<guibutton>datum</guibutton> kan du välja format genom att klicka på pilen "
"bredvid symbolen och sedan välja ett alternativ. Förutom "
"<guibutton>sidnummer</guibutton>, det totala antalet "
"<guibutton>sidor</guibutton> och namnet på kalkylbladet kan du infoga "
"<guibutton>filnamn</guibutton> och/eller <guibutton>sökväg</guibutton>. Du "
"kan även visa en angiven <guibutton>cell</guibutton> i sidhuvudet eller "
"sidfoten. Dessutom finns särskilda <keycap>opcodes</keycap> för vanliga "
"alternativ:"
